      "cost": "free",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> When Phomandala's next action is to cast a spell that is 7th level or lower, she reduces the number of actions to cast it by 1 (minimum 1 action).</p>",
