      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:41]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[6d6[poison]] damage and Enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[9d6[poison]] damage and Enfeebled 2 (1 round)</p>",
      "frequency": null,
